//  The prevailing wind blows FROM the south-west (true bearing 225 deg); the
//  plot plan's +y axis points to true north.  An ignition source within
//  +/- 30 deg of the DOWNWIND direction and within 60 m of a release source
//  is announced.  The control room stands upwind, so nothing is.
wind
{
    from        225 deg;
    planNorth   0 deg;
    halfAngle   30 deg;
